<title>USA: African Development Bank to issue global debt.</title>
<headline>African Development Bank to issue global debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>African Development Bank is expected to tap the market with a $1.0 billion global debt offering near-term, syndicate sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to consist of a AAA-rated 10-year issue, syndicate sources added.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>(( --Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
